      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "# Compliance Audit Report: Fintech Data Privacy Regulations\n\n## Introduction\nThis report evaluates the compliance of our fintech company with new data privacy regulations concerning biometric data.\n\n## Biometric Data Encryption\nOur company ensures all user biometric data is encrypted at rest using AES-256 or higher. This encryption standard meets the regulatory requirements for data protection.\n\n## Access Control to Decryption Keys\nAccess to decryption keys is restricted to authorized personnel through multi-factor authentication. This measure ensures that only authorized individuals can access sensitive biometric data.\n\n## Access Logs Maintenance\nWe maintain logs of every access attempt to biometric data for a period of 7 years. This practice helps in tracking and auditing access to sensitive data, ensuring compliance with the regulations.\n\n## Breach Reporting\nIn the event of a breach involving biometric data, we are committed to reporting it to the regulator within 24 hours of discovery. This prompt reporting is crucial for regulatory compliance and helps in mitigating any potential harm to users.\n\n## Conclusion\nOur company is committed to complying with the new fintech data privacy regulations. The measures outlined in this report demonstrate our dedication to protecting user biometric data and maintaining regulatory compliance.",
